{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2020-07-02 19:30:00', 'title': 'IBM SAYS CO & IBM CREDIT LLC ENTERED INTO NEW $2.5 BILLION 364-DAY CREDIT AGREEMENT', 'text': 'IBM - ON JULY 2, CO & IBM CREDIT LLC ENTERED INTO A NEW $2.5 BILLION 364-DAY CREDIT AGREEMENT.IBM - ENTERED INTO FIRST AMENDMENT TO EXISTING $2.5 BILLION AMENDED & RESTATED 3-YEAR CREDIT AGREEMENT DATED AS OF JULY 19, 2018.IBM - ALSO, ON JULY 2, ENTERED INTO FIRST AMENDMENT TO EXISTING $10.25 BILLION AMENDED & RESTATED 5-YEAR CREDIT AGREEMENT DATED AS OF JULY 19, 2018.IBM - NEW 364-DAY CREDIT AGREEMENT PERMITS BORROWERS TO BORROW UP TO $2.5 BILLION ON REVOLVING BASIS AT ANY TIME DURING TERM OF NEW CREDIT AGREEMENT.IBM - 3-YEAR AMENDMENT, AMONG OTHER THINGS, MODIFIES & EXTENDS MATURITY OF EXISTING 3-YEAR CREDIT AGREEMENT TO JULY 20, 2023.IBM - 5-YEAR AMENDMENT, PERMITS CO TO REQUEST, AT ANY TIME DURING SPECIFIED PERIOD IN YEAR ENDED DEC 31, 2021, EXTENSION OF MATURITY OF AGREEMENT BY 2 YRS.'}